      "writtenOn": "2019-06-03T21:25:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes, we don\u0027t maintain any client context for a fixed client.\nbut, In HECI spcec, bus addresses from 0x01 ~ 0x1F are reserved for fixed clients.\nSo dynamic client starts from 0x20 bus address and it uses the first(0th) client context element.",
